.TH DEMAKE\-INIT 1 "" "" "Scaffold a project folder and the Demakefile that reproduces the defaults"
.SH NAME
demake-init \- Scaffold a project folder and the Demakefile that reproduces the defaults
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdemake init\fR [\fIoptions\fR] [\fIdirectory\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Scaffold a project folder and the Demakefile that reproduces the defaults.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-force\fR
Overwrite an existing Demakefile.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Report what was written as JSON.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
demake init
.br
a Demakefile beside the game already here
.PP
demake init ./pong
.br
the canonical folders, in a new project
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBdemake\fR(1)
